    "explanation": "task.toml, instruction.md, solution/ (solve.sh -> solve.py replay + emit_oracle_trajectory.py + write_artifacts.py from artifact_plan.json), tests/manifest.json (13 verifier_configs), tests/test.sh -> test_gvs.sh -> test_outputs.py + verifier_engine.py + rl_world_verifiers, and environment/ (Dockerfile, entrypoint.sh, mcp proxy, _app mirror) jointly describe one executable, gradable task. instruction_sha256 in tests/manifest.json (bdd3141...) matches instruction.md byte-for-byte, and environment/_app/ is an exact mirror of task.toml, instruction.md and tests/ (diff -r clean). Every mandatory subcheck passes."
  },
  "layer1_package_consistency__cross_artifact_consistency": {
    "outcome": "pass",
    "explanation": "No source is missing. Deliverable paths agree everywhere: instruction.md asks for /workspace/review_log.md and /workspace/metrics.xlsx; solution/artifact_plan.json emits exactly those names through write_artifacts.py into $WORKSPACE (default /workspace); tests/manifest.json file_check sources read 'review_log.md' and 'metrics.xlsx' relative to the workspace resolved by _run_file_check (TH_WORKSPACE_DIR or /workspace, which is the Dockerfile WORKDIR owned by rlgymagent). Connector declarations (notion-gym, port 8019, proxy http://localhost:7000/mcp/notion-gym, x-notion-user-token) match environment/mcp/proxy/server.py and the healthcheck. environment/_app mirror is byte-identical to the task root files it mirrors."
  },
